#: antispamwizard.cpp:683
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can get some assistance in setting up KMail's filter rules to "
"use some commonly-known anti-spam tools.</p>"
"<p>The wizard can detect those tools on your computer as well as create "
"filter rules to classify messages using these tools and to separate messages "
"classified as spam. The wizard will not take any existing filter rules into "
"consideration: it will always append the new rules.</p>"
"<p><b>Warning:</b> As KMail appears to be frozen during the scan of the "
"messages for spam, you may encounter problems with the responsiveness of "
"KMail because anti-spam tool operations are usually time consuming; please "
"consider deleting the filter rules created by the wizard to get back to the "
"former behavior."
msgstr ""
"<p>Aquí pode obter algunha axuda para estabelecer as regras de filtraxe de "
"KMail no senso de empregar algunhas das ferramentas máis coñecidas contra "
"o correo-lixo.</p> "
"<p>O asistente pode detectas estas ferramentas no seu ordenador así coma "
"crear regras de filtraxe para clasificar as mensaxes empregando estas "
"ferramentas e para separar as mensaxes clasificadas coma correo-lixo. O "
"asistente non terá en conta ningunha regla de filtraxe xa existente: sempre "
"engadirá as novas reglas.</p> "
"<p><b>Coidado:</b> Xa que KMail está bloqueado durante o escaneado de "
"mensaxes, pode que atope problemas coa respostabilidade de KMail, xa que "
"estas operacións contra o correo-lixo consumen normalmente algo de tempo; "
"por favor, considere borrar as reglas de filtraxe se quere volver ao "
"comportamento anterior."

#: antispamwizard.cpp:698
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can get some assistance in setting up KMail's filter rules to "
"use some commonly-known anti-virus tools.</p>"
"<p>The wizard can detect those tools on your computer as well as create "
"filter rules to classify messages using these tools and to separate messages "
"containing viruses. The wizard will not take any existing filter rules into "
"consideration: it will always append the new rules.</p>"
"<p><b>Warning:</b> As KMail appears to be frozen during the scan of the "
"messages for viruses, you may encounter problems with the responsiveness of "
"KMail because anti-virus tool operations are usually time consuming; please "
"consider deleting the filter rules created by the wizard to get back to the "
"former behavior."
msgstr ""
"<p>Aquí pode obter algunha axuda para estabelecer as regras de filtraxe de "
"KMail no senso de empregar algunhas das ferramentas máis coñecidas contra "
"os virus.</p> "
"<p>O asistente pode detectas estas ferramentas no seu ordenador así coma "
"crear regras de filtraxe para clasificar as mensaxes empregando estas "
"ferramentas e para separar as mensaxes que conteñan virus. O asistente non "
"terá en conta ningunha regla de filtraxe xa existente: sempre engadirá as "
"novas reglas.</p> "
"<p><b>Coidado:</b> Xa que KMail está bloqueado durante o escaneado de "
"mensaxes, pode que atope problemas coa respostabilidade de KMail, xa que "
"estas operacións contra os virus consumen normalmente algo de tempo; por "
"favor, considere borrar as reglas de filtraxe se quere volver ao "
"comportamento anterior."

#: antispamwizard.cpp:755
msgid ""
"<p>For these tools it is possible to let the wizard create filter rules. "
"KMail tried to find the tools in the PATH of your system; the wizard does "
"not allow you to create rules for tools which were not found: this is to "
"keep your configuration consistent and to minimize the risk of unpredicted "
"behavior.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"Para esteas ferramentas é posíbel deixar que o asistente cree as reglas de "
"filtraxe. KMail tentou procurar as ferramentes no PATH do seu sistema; o "
"asistente non lle permite crear as reglas para ferramentas que non se "
"atoparon: isto é para manter a súa configuración con consistencia e para "
"minimizar o risco de comportamentos impredecíbeis.</p>"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:780
msgid "(found on this system)"
msgstr "(atopado neste sistema)"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:781
msgid "(not found on this system)"
msgstr "(non atopado neste sistema)"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:809
msgid "Classify messages manually as spam"
msgstr "Clasificar as mensaxes manualmente coma lixo"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:811
msgid ""
"Sometimes messages are classified wrongly or even not at all; the latter "
"might be by intention, because you perhaps filter out messages from mailing "
"lists before you let the anti-spam tools classify the rest of the messages. "
"You can correct these wrong or missing classifications manually by using the "
"appropriate toolbar buttons which trigger special filters created by this "
"wizard."
msgstr ""
"Algunhas veces as mensaxes calsifícanse mal ou mesmo non de todo; o "
"derradeiro podería ser por intención, porque quizabes filtre as mensaxes "
"das listas de correo-e antes de permitir que as ferramentas de filtraxe as "
"clasifiquen co resto das mensaxes. Pode correo estas clasificacións "
"erróneas ou inexistentes manualmente empregando os botóns axeitados da "
"barra de ferramentas que priorizan os filtros creados por este asistente."

#: antispamwizard.cpp:820
msgid "Classify messages using the anti-spam tools"
msgstr "Clasificar as mensaxes empregando as ferramentas anticorreo-lixo"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:822
msgid ""
"Let the anti-spam tools classify your messages. The wizard will create "
"appropriate filters. The messages are usually marked by the tools so that "
"following filters can react on this and, for example, move spam messages to "
"a special folder."
msgstr ""
"Permitir que as ferramentas anti-correolixo clasifiquen as súas mensaxes. O "
"asistente creará os filtros axeitados. As mensaxes márcanse normalmente "
"polas ferramentas de xeito que os seguintes filtros poden reaccionar, por "
"exemplo, movendo as mensaxes lixo a un cartafol especial."

#: antispamwizard.cpp:828
msgid "Move detected spam messages to the selected folder"
msgstr "Movidas as mensaxes detectadas coma lixo ao cartafol seleccionado"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:830
msgid ""
"A filter to detect messages classified as spam and to move those messages "
"into a predefined folder is created. The default folder is the trash folder, "
"but you may change that in the folder view."
msgstr ""
"Un filtro para detectar as mensaxes clasificadas coma correo-e lixo e para "
"mover estas mensaxes nun cartafol predefinido. O cartafol por defecto é o "
"de correo lixo, pero pode trocalo na vista de cartafoles."

#: antispamwizard.cpp:836
msgid "Additionally, mark detected spam messages as read"
msgstr "Adicionalmente, marcar as mensaxes detectadas coma lixo coma lidas"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:839
msgid ""
"Mark messages which have been classified as spam as read, as well as moving "
"them to the selected folder."
msgstr ""
"Marcar as mensaxes que foron calsificadas coma lixo coma lidas, así como "
"movelas ao cartafol seleccionado."

